; case: invalid-execution-bound-in-task
; expect: invalid-description
; why: A worst-case execution time inside a task. §7.3 keeps bounds in the build manifest;
;   this is the case the schema could not see before M1.7.
;
(defsystem s
  (task t (period 10 ms) (deadline 10 ms) (deadline-from release) (priority 1) (wcet 850 us)))
